  "id": "misattunement",
  "term": "misattunement",
  "definition": "Misattunement is a mismatch in emotional connection or understanding within a relationship, where one person does not feel accurately recognized, responded to, or supported by the other. In this context, it describes relational breakdowns that can contribute to distress and anger.",
